## Quick classify

1. Read user intent → match domain #1–22 in `SYSTEM-TAXONOMY.md`
2. Route via `rules/auto-orchestrator.mdc` (one skill + one MCP max)
3. External repo? Check `EXTERNAL-CATALOG.md` — **reference**, don't bulk-install
4. Agency persona? Max 2 divisions via `AGENCY-PORTFOLIO-MAP.md`

